<style>
  .page-hero { background: var(--blush); padding: 56px 40px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .page-hero p.eyebrow { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .page-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); font-weight: 300; }
  .page-hero h1 em { font-style: italic; }
  .page-hero .subtitle { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); margin-top: 14px; }
  .page-hero .subtitle a { color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); }
  .faq-layout { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 40px 80px; }
  .faq-tabs { display: flex; gap: 0; margin-bottom: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-tab { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; padding: 14px 28px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--mid-grey); border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; margin-bottom: -1px; transition: all 0.2s; background: none; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-right: none; font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .faq-tab:hover { color: var(--charcoal); }
  .faq-tab.active { color: var(--charcoal); border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  .faq-section { display: none; }
  .faq-section.active { display: block; }
  .faq-section-intro { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-item:first-of-type { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-question { width: 100%; background: none; border: none; padding: 22px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; font-family: var(--font-sans); }
  .faq-question-text { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--charcoal); line-height: 1.5; }
  .faq-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--gold); font-size: 16px; transition: transform 0.25s, background 0.2s; }
  .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); background: var(--gold); color: var(--white); border-color: var(--gold); }
  .faq-answer { display: none; padding: 0 0 22px; }
  .faq-item.open .faq-answer { display: block; }
  .faq-answer p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .faq-answer p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .faq-answer a { color: var(--gold); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold); }
  .faq-answer ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 8px 0; }
  .faq-answer ul li { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mid-grey); line-height: 1.9; padding: 4px 0 4px 20px; position: relative; }
  .faq-answer ul li::before { content: '—'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--gold); }
  .contact-cta { background: var(--charcoal); color: var(--white); padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center; margin-top: 64px; }
  .contact-cta h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .contact-cta p { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .contact-cta a { display: inline-block; padding: 13px 40px; border: 1px solid var(--white); color: var(--white); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 500; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .contact-cta a:hover { background: var(--white); color: var(--charcoal); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero { padding: 40px 20px; }
    .faq-layout { padding: 32px 16px 60px; }
    .faq-tabs { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
    .faq-tab { white-space: nowrap; padding: 14px 14px; font-size: 10px; }
    .faq-question-text { font-size: 14px; }
    .contact-cta { padding: 40px 20px; }
  }
</style>

<div class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Melia Nae</p>
  <h1>Frequently Asked <em>Questions</em></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Can't find what you're looking for? <a href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a> and we'll be happy to help.</p>
</div>

<div class="faq-layout">
  <div class="faq-tabs">
    <button class="faq-tab active" onclick="showTab('orders')">Orders &amp; Shipping</button>
    <button class="faq-tab" onclick="showTab('care')">Jewellery Care</button>
    <button class="faq-tab" onclick="showTab('custom')">Custom &amp; Engraving</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ORDERS & SHIPPING -->
  <div class="faq-section active" id="tab-orders">
    <p class="faq-section-intro">Everything you need to know about placing an order, payment options, and getting your jewellery delivered.</p>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">What payment methods do you accept?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>We accept all major credit and debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express), as well as PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Afterpay, and Zip. All transactions are processed securely.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you offer Afterpay or buy-now-pay-later?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! We offer both Afterpay and Zip, so you can spread the cost into interest-free instalments. Simply select your preferred option at checkout.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How long will it take to receive my order?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Orders are processed within 1–2 business days and shipped via Australia Post.</p><ul><li>Standard domestic: 3–7 business days</li><li>Express domestic: 1–3 business days</li><li>International: 10–28 business days depending on destination</li></ul></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you offer free shipping?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes — free standard shipping is available on all Australian orders over $150 AUD, applied automatically at checkout.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I track my order?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Once your order is dispatched you'll receive a shipping confirmation email with your Australia Post tracking number. If you haven't received tracking details within 3 business days, please <a href="/pages/contact">get in touch</a>.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you ship internationally?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes, we ship worldwide via Australia Post International. Shipping rates are calculated at checkout. International orders may be subject to import duties and taxes, which are the responsibility of the recipient.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">What is your returns policy?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>We do not offer refunds. However, we are happy to offer an exchange on eligible items within 30 days of delivery, provided they are unworn and in their original condition.</p><p>Custom, engraved, and personalised pieces are not eligible for exchange unless faulty.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Is my jewellery gift wrapped?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Every Melia Nae order arrives in our signature gift box — beautifully presented and ready to give. We use discreet outer packaging so the contents remain a surprise.</p></div></div>
  </div>

  <!-- JEWELLERY CARE -->
  <div class="faq-section" id="tab-care">
    <p class="faq-section-intro">Our jewellery is crafted to be worn and loved. With a little care, your pieces will stay beautiful for years to come.</p>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">What metals do you use?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Our collection includes sterling silver, gold-plated, gold-filled, and solid gold pieces, as well as lab-grown diamond and moissanite jewellery. Each product page details the specific metal used.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Is your jewellery hypoallergenic?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Our sterling silver pieces are 925 sterling silver and are generally well-tolerated by those with metal sensitivities. If you have a known nickel allergy, we recommend solid gold or sterling silver pieces rather than gold-plated styles.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I care for gold-plated jewellery?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><ul><li>Remove before swimming, showering, or exercising</li><li>Avoid contact with perfume, body lotion, and harsh chemicals</li><li>Wipe gently with a soft, dry cloth after wearing</li><li>Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight</li></ul></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I clean my jewellery at home?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>For sterling silver and solid gold pieces, a gentle clean with warm water and a drop of mild dish soap works well. Use a soft toothbrush for intricate details, then rinse and dry thoroughly.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I wear my jewellery in the shower or pool?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>We recommend removing all jewellery before showering, swimming, or entering a spa or pool. Chlorine, saltwater, and soaps can accelerate tarnishing and damage plating over time.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you offer a warranty or repairs?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes — we stand behind the quality of our jewellery. If a piece develops a fault due to a manufacturing defect, please <a href="/pages/contact">contact us</a> and we'll arrange a repair or replacement.</p></div></div>
  </div>

  <!-- CUSTOM & ENGRAVING -->
  <div class="faq-section" id="tab-custom">
    <p class="faq-section-intro">Make it yours. Our custom and engraving services let you create something truly one-of-a-kind.</p>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Do you offer custom jewellery?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes — we love bringing custom pieces to life. Browse our <a href="/pages/customs-gallery">Customs Gallery</a> for inspiration, then <a href="/pages/contact">get in touch</a> to start the conversation.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Which pieces can be engraved?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Many of our lockets, rings, and pendants are available with engraving. If an item supports engraving, you'll see the option on the product page. Feel free to contact us for pieces not listed as engravable.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How long does engraving take?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Engraved pieces typically require 3–5 additional business days before dispatch. For fully custom orders, turnaround time will be confirmed at the time of enquiry.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I return or exchange an engraved or custom piece?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Because engraved and custom pieces are made specifically for you, we are unable to offer an exchange unless the item arrives faulty or damaged. We do not offer refunds. Please double-check all personalisation details before placing your order.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I find my ring size?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Visit our <a href="/pages/ring-sizer">Ring Sizer page</a> for full instructions and our size conversion chart. If you're between sizes, we recommend sizing up.</p></div></div>

    <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFaq(this)"><span class="faq-question-text">How do I get started with a custom order?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-answer"><p>Reach out via our <a href="/pages/contact">contact page</a> or email <a href="mailto:melianae@outlook.com">melianae@outlook.com</a>. Share as much detail as you can — inspiration images, materials, budget, and occasion — and our team will get back to you with next steps.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="contact-cta">
  <h3>Still Have Questions?</h3>
  <p>Our team is here to help — reach out and we'll get back to you promptly.</p>
  <a href="/pages/contact">Get in Touch</a>
</div>

<script>
  function showTab(id) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-tab').forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
    document.querySelectorAll('.faq-section').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
    event.currentTarget.classList.add('active');
    document.getElementById('tab-' + id).classList.add('active');
  }
  function toggleFaq(btn) {
    const item = btn.closest('.faq-item');
    const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
    btn.closest('.faq-section').querySelectorAll('.faq-item.open').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('open'));
    if (!isOpen) item.classList.add('open');
  }
</script>
